  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="10.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 10.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And æni man heonan forð cirican ne ðeowige, ne ciricmangunge mid unrihte ne macyge, ne ciricðen ne utige buton biscopes geþeahte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no-one henceforth shall oppress the church, or make it an object of improper traffic, or turn out a minister of the church without the bishop's consent.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And ænig man heonan forð cyrican ne ðeowige, ne cyricmagunge mid unriht ne macie, ne cyricþen ne utige butan biscopes geþehte.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
